package quiz.thaton3app.nazo.data

/**
 * Local question bank — the app's offline data source used while the AI/API path
 * is not configured (or as a fallback). This stands in for a real local database
 * and is the single place quiz content lives so it can later be swapped for a Room
 * table or the remote API without touching the UI.
 *
 * Questions are tagged with `anime` (series), `theme` (sub-category) and a
 * `difficulty` tier (Easy / Medium / Hard / Otaku Master) so the statistics engine
 * can aggregate "top mastered anime" and so higher difficulties actually serve
 * harder questions, not just a shorter timer.
 */
